                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does it cost to launch a D2C serum brand in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Minimum viable: Rs 15-30 lakh (2-3 SKUs + minimal marketing). Serious market entry: Rs 30 lakh-Rs 1.5 Cr (4-8 SKUs + marketing + Nykaa + creator + dermatologist network). Premium clinical-positioning launch: Rs 1.5-5 Cr+.</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need BIS + FDA for a serum brand in India?</h3>
                                        <p>BIS Cosmetics registration mandatory for cosmetic sale India. FDA (Ayush) required if drug claims or Ayurveda formulation. State Drug Controller for manufacturing licence. Testing (stability + safety + microbiological) required.</p>
                                        <h3>How long does it take to launch a serum brand in India?</h3>
                                        <p>14-24 weeks typical from concept to launch. Formulation + testing: 12-20 weeks (parallel to entity + tech). Manufacturing MOQ delivery: 6-10 weeks. Marketing prep: 6-8 weeks (parallel). Compliance + BIS: 6-12 weeks (parallel).</p>
                                        <h3>Which is the best marketplace for a new D2C serum brand in India?</h3>
